  "notes": [
    "Regular -ER verb — follows standard -ER endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *temido* (regular)",
    "Means \"to fear\" or \"to be afraid of\" — *temo a las arañas* (I'm afraid of spiders), *temo que llegue tarde* (I'm afraid he'll arrive late)",
    "Often followed by *que* + subjunctive when expressing fear about a situation: *temo que no venga*",
    "Related: *temor* (fear, noun), *temible* (fearsome), *temeroso/a* (fearful)"
